note right of UnicornDVCPlugin.CTXSpecific.vdunicorn 
    CTX requires different protocols to set up the neccessary connections.
    vdunicorn contains these protocol functions.
end note

note bottom of UnicornDVCPlugin.CDVCPlugin
    CDVCPlugin.h has 2 other class defined, namely: ListenerCallback and ChannelCallback.
    Both have their respective functions: OnNewChannelConnection for the ListenerCallback; 
    OnDataReceived() and OnClose() for the ChannelCallback.
    Additionally, the CDVCPlugin.cpp has 3 DVCCNT Implementation of the applib.
end note

