note as UnicornDVCAppLib.Note0
    UnicornDVC_CTX_AppLib has the same content as the UnicornDVCAppLib.
    The only difference is DVCServer being different for CTX as different protocols need to be called.
    Note that the DVCServerCTX.h's difference is only in the includes.
end note

